From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ombra engine maintainers <engine@ombra.local>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] MCP oauth.clientName for dynamic client registration (Ombra
 registers as "Ombra"), allowlist refusal message for 401/403 registration
 (Figma), Figma desktop server not-running message, shared sign-out used by
 /mcp unauth and RPC mcp_logout

What: MCP oauth.clientName for dynamic client registration (Ombra registers as "Ombra"), allowlist refusal message for 401/403 registration (Figma), Figma desktop server not-running message, shared sign-out used by /mcp unauth and RPC mcp_logout
Why: Figma remote MCP admits only allowlisted client names; users need a clear error, an override and sign-in/out from Ombra
Upstream-Status: Ombra-specific; clientName and refusal message could be submitted upstream

